- Rebased onto dinguyen/socfpga_svc_fixes_for_v7.2 (includes bfd2eb9
  probe goto cleanup).
- COMMAND_RSU_GET_DEVICE_INFO probe error path uses goto
  remove_async_client instead of inline
  stratix10_svc_remove_async_client() + stratix10_svc_free_channel() +
  return (as in v3 patch 2/3).
- Device-info SMC/service-layer implementation and sysfs attributes are
  unchanged from v3.
